---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Code of Conduct" 
  description="Cyber Scotland Connect Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct and community pledge."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66] pb-8 mb-10 transition-colors">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#56548c] dark:text-[#6fb7e6] block mb-1">
        Community Standards & Safety
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight transition-colors">
        Code of Conduct
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf] text-base mt-2">
        Adapted from the Contributor Covenant, version 2.1.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-[#2a2948] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66] shadow-sm transition-colors text-slate-700 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase mb-4">Our Pledge</h2>
        <p>
          We as members, contributors, and leaders pledge to make participation in our community a harassment-free experience for everyone, regardless of age, body size, visible or invisible disability, ethnicity, sex characteristics, gender identity and expression, level of experience, education, socio-economic status, nationality, personal appearance, race, caste, color, religion, or sexual identity and orientation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We pledge to act and interact in ways that contribute to an open, welcoming, diverse, inclusive, and healthy community.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-[#2a2948] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66] shadow-sm transition-colors text-slate-700 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase mb-4">Our Standards</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">Positive community behaviors include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm mb-6">
          <li>Demonstrating empathy and kindness toward other people</li>
          <li>Being respectful of differing opinions, viewpoints, and experiences</li>
          <li>Giving and gracefully accepting constructive feedback</li>
          <li>Accepting responsibility, apologizing to those affected by our mistakes, and learning from the experience</li>
          <li>Focusing on what is best not just for us as individuals, but for the overall Scottish community</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mb-3 font-semibold text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300">Unacceptable behaviors include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>The use of sexualized language or imagery, and sexual attention or advances of any kind</li>
          <li>Trolling, insulting or derogatory comments, and personal or political attacks</li>
          <li>Public or private harassment</li>
          <li>Publishing others' private information without their explicit permission (doxing)</li>
          <li>Aggressive corporate pitching, unsolicited recruiting pressure, or sales outreach at meetups</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1b1a30] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66] transition-colors text-slate-700 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase mb-4">Reporting & Enforcement</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm">
          Instances of abusive, harassing, or otherwise unacceptable behavior may be reported to the community organizers at:
        </p>
        <a 
          href="mailto:conduct@cyberscotlandconnect.com"
          class="inline-block px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#895294] text-white font-bold text-sm hover:bg-[#9d5fa8] transition-colors"
        >
          conduct@cyberscotlandconnect.com
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-4">
          All complaints will be reviewed and investigated promptly and fairly. All community leaders are obligated to respect the privacy and security of the reporter of any incident.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
